{
  "name": "21 · Product Description Writer (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 21 · Product Description Writer\nAdd a product row with a few notes → AI writes the **title, description, Instagram caption and hashtags** and writes them back into the same row (Status = ready for review). Good for Meesho, Amazon, your website or WhatsApp catalogue.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Products**: SKU, Product, Category, Price, Features, Status (new), Title, Description, Caption, Hashtags, Updated.\n2. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nCheck the text before you publish it.",
        "height": 490,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "29f6d447-c524-4f65-8011-c0a5d8bcf3b1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2c26e87c-315d-4bf3-a925-baec57ff783f",
      "name": "Every 30 min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Products"
        },
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
